     <LINES>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT>U1</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>&amp;FUNCTIONALITY&amp;</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT>AS</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>The /CTDI/CL_PRINT_DRIVER_LEGACY class is the subclass responsible for</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT></TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE> executing legacy printing logic. It executes the print_old subroutine</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT></TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE> inside /CELLAG/ALCAREP02 if a legacy layout name is configured.</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT>U1</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT>AS</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>This class redefines the protected action hooks to:</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT>B1</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>- unpack_io_data: Retrieve generic print execution parameters.</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT>B1</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>- fetch_data_from_db: Select legacy repair/order data via the legacy</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT></TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>  data provider /CTDI/CL_PRINT_DATA_LEGACY.</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT>B1</TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>- map_and_register_data: Map standard parameters and register data</TDLINE>
      </item>
      <item>
       <TDFORMAT></TDFORMAT>
       <TDLINE>  structures for legacy Smart Forms rendering.</TDLINE>
      </item>
     </LINES>
    </item>
    <item>
